  "title": "HTTP3: Guarantee unique offsets for the header data",
  "description": "Don't just use the offset in the current subset tvb,\nuse tvb_raw_offset() as well. Go further and cover\nthe case where there are multiple QUIC packets in the\nsame frame, and even in the same QUIC layer (thanks to\ncoalescing.)\n\nFix #19474\n\n\n(cherry picked from commit cb211724472af936a1c67291e18147a7ccf60050)",
